.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH cadcraft-cli-info 1  "info " 
.SH NAME
cadcraft\-cli\-info \- Print a drawing\*(Aqs summary as JSON
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBcadcraft\-cli info\fR [\fB\-\-compact\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIFILE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print a drawing\*(Aqs summary as JSON
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-compact\fR
One line of JSON instead of pretty\-printed
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIFILE\fR>
The drawing to read (dxf, dwg, svg, svgz)
